  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The formula for mutual inductance is given by, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#949;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#949;</mi><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p>Dimension of&nbsp;emf or voltage is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>,<br />Dimension of&nbsp;current is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></math>,<br />Dimension of time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Therefore, the dimension of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> is<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
